e":"81"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"82"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The youngest sister of the Kominezaki family. The protagonist's underclassman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A loli-debu type, with a body that's small, round and taut like a rubber ball. Eating is her side hobby. She refuses to do housework."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She initially resists the protagonist, keeping her attitude sharp and her heart closed off. As far as Ranko's concerned, men are \"the enemy\"-- thus, she rejects him without hesitation. Apparently this is due to something that happened in her past..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even after being rejected so much, the protagonist still tries to get closer to her. Will Ranko open her heart to him...?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21885"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小嶺崎三姉妹の三女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・頼雅の下級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小柄だがゴム毬のように張り詰めたロリデブ体型。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食べる側専門。家事炊事は一切パス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学業成績優秀。運動も人並みレベル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「蘭子が男なんかに、負けるはずないんだからッ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5163","sourceWorkId":"17542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小嶺崎三姉妹の三女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・頼雅の下級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小柄だがゴム毬のように張り詰めたロリデブ体型。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食べる側専門。家事炊事は一切パス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学業成績優秀。運動も人並みレベル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「蘭子が男なんかに、負けるはずないんだからッ！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"168833"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5163","sourceWorkId":"17542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5163","sourceWorkId":"17542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"96 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5163","sourceWorkId":"17542","source