lationship with, as is the desire of most boys his age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But his tastes are very specific-- he only likes fat girls. Convinced he'd never find his ideal lover, Yorimasa thought he'd be lonely for his entire life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although normally a very earnest person, sometimes his desires get the better of him, and he does unreasonable things. He's also a bit tough to reach in terms of emotional matters, he doesn't seem to notice when he's hurt someone's feelings and he misunderstands the situation sometimes."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39132"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p765","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1121","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p765","name":"わるきゅ～れ","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:17542:1121","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p765","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p765","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p765","name":"わるきゅ～れ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:176320:v11225","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p765","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p765","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p765","name":"わるきゅ～れ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:26859:v11225","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p765","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p765","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p765","name":"わるきゅ～れ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:26860:v11225","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
